</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DS-MoE</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gain</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Computational Complexity</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(dn)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(dn)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(k\log n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(k\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim 70\text{--}80\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>–</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 70\text{--}80\%</annotation></semantics></math> reduction</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Memory Complexity</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(dn)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(dn)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(kn)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(kn)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Linear savings proportional to <math id="S3.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k/d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k/d</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Dynamic Reasoning Chains through Depth-Specialised Mixture-of-Experts (DS-MoE)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Input sequence <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=\{x_{1},x_{2},\dots,x_{n}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=\{x_{1},x_{2},\dots,x_{n}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Expert modules <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}=\{E_{1},E_{2},\dots,E_{m}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}=\{E_{1},E_{2},\dots,E_{m}\}</annotation></semantics></math> where:

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{1},\dots,E_{j_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{1},\dots,E_{j_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>: Shallow Pattern Experts (SPE)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{j_{1}+1},\dots,E_{j_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{j_{1}+1},\dots,E_{j_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>: Compositional Reasoning Experts (CRE)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{j_{2}+1},\dots,E_{j_{3}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{j_{2}+1},\dots,E_{j_{3}}</annotation></semantics></math>: Logical Inference Experts (LIE)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{j_{3}+1},\dots,E_{j_{4}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{j_{3}+1},\dots,E_{j_{4}}</annotation></semantics></math>: Memory Integration Experts (MIE)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{j_{4}+1},\dots,E_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{j_{4}+1},\dots,E_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>: Meta-Cognitive Experts (MCE)

</div>
