              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5c.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
             Output <math id="alg1.l5c.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 1: Input Complexity Analysis</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
             Compute syntactic complexity: <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{syn}\leftarrow\text{ParseDepth}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ParseDepth</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{syn}\leftarrow\text{ParseDepth}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
             Compute semantic density: <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{sem}\leftarrow\text{ConceptDensity}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ConceptDensity</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{sem}\leftarrow\text{ConceptDensity}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
             Estimate reasoning steps: <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\leftarrow\text{ClauseChaining}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ClauseChaining</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\leftarrow\text{ClauseChaining}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
             Calculate complexity score: <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C(X)\leftarrow\alpha d_{syn}+\beta c_{sem}+\gamma r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C(X)\leftarrow\alpha d_{syn}+\beta c_{sem}+\gamma r</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 2: Expert Selection via Routing</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
             Compute feature representation: <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi(X)\leftarrow\text{FeatureExtractor}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>FeatureExtractor</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi(X)\leftarrow\text{FeatureExtractor}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
             Calculate routing probabilities: <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(E_{j}|X)\leftarrow\text{softmax}(W\cdot\phi(X))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(E_{j}|X)\leftarrow\text{softmax}(W\cdot\phi(X))</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in[1,m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in[1,m]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
              
              
             Select top-<math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> experts: <math id="alg1.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}(X)\leftarrow\{E_{j}\mid P(E_{j}|X)\text{ is in top-}k\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> is in top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}(X)\leftarrow\{E_{j}\mid P(E_{j}|X)\text{ is in top-}k\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
              
              
             Sort selected experts by routing probability: <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{E_{i_{1}},E_{i_{2}},\dots,E_{i_{k}}\}\leftarrow\text{Sort}(\mathcal{S}(X))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Sort</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{E_{i_{1}},E_{i_{2}},\dots,E_{i_{k}}\}\leftarrow\text{Sort}(\mathcal{S}(X))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 3: Dynamic Chain Construction</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
              
              
             Initialize hidden state: <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{0}\leftarrow\text{Embed}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Embed</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0}\leftarrow\text{Embed}(X)</annotation></semantics></math>

