<span id="S5.T5.2.6.9.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:128.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T5.2.6.9.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Excellent on shallow tasks, fails on deep tasks</span>
</span></td></tr>
